     "s": "Professor",
     "t": "Now, why does this matter for investors? Well, consider what's known as the disposition effect."
    },
    {
     "s": "Professor",
     "t": "Investors tend to sell shares that have risen in value too early, in order to lock in a gain, while holding on to shares that have fallen, hoping they'll recover."
    },
