      "Guiding choices while preserving freedom to choose otherwise.",
      "Removing all government influence.",
      "Paying people to behave well."
     ],
     "answer": "Guiding choices while preserving freedom to choose otherwise.",
     "explanation": "Line 3."
    },
    {
     "id": "q3",
     "prompt": "What is the critics' main objection?",
     "options": [
      "Nudges are too expensive.",
      "Nudges bypass people's reasoning.",
      "Nudges never work.",
      "Nudges are illegal."
     ],
     "answer": "Nudges bypass people's reasoning.",
     "explanation": "Line 4."
    },
